  "foot": {
    "text": "Hart 0 returns PREPARE ACK; hart 1 does not. No timeout: the CCU keeps line X locked and slot T2 allocated, leaves stable MESI and directory metadata unchanged, and sends neither COMMIT nor requester grant. A different line may progress only with independent slot and resources. Reset is the only recovery. Logical aliases, not finalized RTL ports; spacing is illustrative, not a latency bound."
